  "furtherNotes": "Makes 5 servings. Prep time: 15 minutes (plus marinating), Cook time: 35 minutes. Storage: Refrigerate 4 days, freezes well for up to 3 months. Sauce improves overnight. Use coconut cream for dairy-free version."
}